[[Thor]] used this rope to tether the wild [[Titan]] [[Fenris]].

[[Dante Vale]], [[Zhalia Moon]], [[Sophie Casterwill]], [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Cherit]] found the rope wrapped around a statue in a chamber located within the [[Temple of Thor]]. Because of its magical nature, they could not untie it without the help of Lok's [[Springer]]. They used the rope to tether Fenris, which otherwise could not be defeated due to the magic of the temple, and sent him back to his [[Amulet]]. {{source|Two Powers Become One}}

